        "char_shang_xunzi",
        "house_eternal_yacht",
        "loc_river_of_time",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qing Ye controls Eternal Yacht with the same status as Xing Ye Wang. When Bing Sai Chuan attacks, Qing Ye’s calm expression changes on recognizing immediate time freeze and naming Bing Sai Chuan the time path great expert of Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s generation.",
      "chapters": [
        1694
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "eternal-yacht-clash",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_xing_ye_wang",
        "char_bing_sai_chuan",
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qing Ye later shouts that a River of Time tributary is close and raises the morale of the Heavenly Court Gu Immortals.",
